# Accuracy reports

Ground truth is NGSPICE using the identical BSIM-CMG LEVEL=72 OSDI model.
See [`methodology.md`](methodology.md) for gate and evidence rules.

The [root README](../../README.md) owns package release metadata. A maintenance
release does not requalify these measurements; each report names its evidence
pass. The [campaign plans](../plans/) distinguish frozen training and corrected
runtime evaluation.

## Current NN policy

DirectNet-Full LEVEL=75 is the default NN path. BSIM-AR-Full LEVEL=76 is the
autoregressive alternative. Both are the 80 V7.7.2-trained bundles, scored by
the V7.7.6 runtime. Reports of earlier versions, including retired LEVEL=73/74,
are available in Git history; [the changelog](../CHANGELOG.md#2026-10-01--v776-report-promotion-and-evidence-purge)
records the last revision that holds them.

## Current reports

| file | scope |
