| [`v776-evaluation.md`](v776-evaluation.md) | the full V7.7.6 campaign behind both clean reports, with the NN limiter off (scored) and on: L0–L4 levels, per-technology error, limiter re-gate, KCL audit |
| [`v776-case-matrix-off.md`](v776-case-matrix-off.md), [`v776-case-matrix-on.md`](v776-case-matrix-on.md) | technology × test case × model tables for each V7.7.6 arm |

## Clean scoreboard

<!--SCOREBOARD-->

Default status does not rewrite measured limitations. Reports require one
complete provenance-bound campaign; partial passes are never backfilled.
The builder emits clean reports only; named recipe summaries remain in their
isolated run directories. Reproduction commands live in the repository
[README](../../README.md#run-the-complete-clean-checkpoint-matrix).
